  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 3302.02 Approved third party inspection agency",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3302.02 “Approved third party inspection agency” means \"approved third party inspection agency\" as defined in RSA 205-C:1, I. The term includes “third party agency” and “agency”.\n\nSource. #9752, eff 7-9-10; ss by #9752, eff 7-9-10; ss by #12737, eff 3-8-19 (formerly Saf-C 3302.01)",
